Aurora fixes the watch branch's Windows desktop zip needs (.github/workflows/watch.yml
applies this to extern/aurora before tools/package_windows.sh). Aurora 51cc8cd does
not build there:

- command_processor.cpp sets sXrStill (aurora_xr_world_still) outside the OpenXR
  block that declares it, so no build without OpenXR compiles.
- gpu.cpp calls dawn::native::GetTogglesUsed, which the MinGW link does not find in
  the Dawn package (gpu.cpp already leaves Dawn's native instance setup out under
  MinGW).

